{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f552983cf2e32098b4add70c59be89567837c28f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x 4 = 1.262$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/9895fe995a6666fce527a51ab7c03a3eedd5be7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x 7 = 1.771$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"19\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/c/80cc347098449f87c7837a47c4654490e400a27f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x \\left(\\frac{49}{16}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"85\" height=\"45\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae4445eaa053edb6ed8d9f4702e9eab5bebed36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1.963 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1.403 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1.544  \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1.018 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1.969$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"513\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using logarithm rules, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/8/5d8e0f87bbd815580d2fca932bfa93e36f904ef7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x \\left(\\frac{49}{16}\\right) = \\log_x \\left((\\frac{7}{4})^{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"205\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c132834236bd0cc4f79ca67d00bbf2d1eb00801a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2 \\times \\log_x \\left(\\frac{7}{4}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"126\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/3363e6f93e3a296b225d9e6757d09910d8e1441e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2 \\times [\\log_x \\left(7\\right) - \\log_x \\left(4\\right)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"201\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33f6e973f6c6e4e7d37dcdd25c12b026295b6667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2 \\times [1.771 - 1.262]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/0/ff0c4db5268c2a7165ddc2558fe5797d79f77a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2 \\times 0.509$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8e8f4ea19655594a1d582940f713218a10e0688.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 1.018}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a